Below is **clean, language-agnostic pseudocode** corresponding to your Python imports. It focuses on **what each component does**, rather than Python syntax.

### Pseudocode — Initialization & Dependencies

```text
# ==============================================================================
# 0. IMPORT NECESSARY LIBRARIES
# ==============================================================================

BEGIN PROGRAM

    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Operating System & Environment
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    IMPORT OperatingSystemUtilities
        PURPOSE:
            - Read environment variables
            - Access system configuration
            - Manage runtime environment

    IMPORT TypeDefinitions
        IMPORT Literal
        IMPORT List

    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Large Language Model
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    IMPORT GroqChatModel
        PURPOSE:
            - Connect application to Groq-hosted LLM
            - Send prompts/messages to the model
            - Receive model-generated responses

    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Web API Framework
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    IMPORT FastAPI
        PURPOSE:
            - Create REST API application
            - Define API endpoints
            - Receive HTTP requests

    IMPORT ORJSONResponse
        PURPOSE:
            - Return high-performance JSON responses

    IMPORT FormData
        PURPOSE:
            - Receive form parameters from HTTP requests

    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Web Search Tool
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    IMPORT TavilySearchTool
        PURPOSE:
            - Perform web searches
            - Retrieve relevant external information
            - Provide search results to the AI agent

    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Agent Workflow / State Machine
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    IMPORT LangGraph

        IMPORT StateGraph
            PURPOSE:
                - Build agent workflow as a graph
                - Define nodes and transitions

        IMPORT END
            PURPOSE:
                - Mark termination of workflow

        IMPORT MessagesState
            PURPOSE:
                - Maintain conversation/message state
                - Pass information between workflow nodes

    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Messages
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    IMPORT HumanMessage
        PURPOSE:
            - Represent user input

    IMPORT SystemMessage
        PURPOSE:
            - Define system-level instructions
            - Control agent behavior

    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Data Validation / Configuration Models
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    IMPORT Pydantic

        IMPORT BaseModel
            PURPOSE:
                - Define structured data models

        IMPORT Field
            PURPOSE:
                - Define validated model fields
                - Specify defaults and constraints

    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Environment Configuration
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    IMPORT EnvironmentLoader

        PURPOSE:
            - Load variables from .env file
            - Make API keys and configuration available

    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Date & Time
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    IMPORT DateTime
        PURPOSE:
            - Generate timestamps
            - Track execution time
            - Record events

    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # Application Server
    # --------------------------------------------------------------------------
    IMPORT Uvicorn
        PURPOSE:
            - Start FastAPI application
            - Run ASGI web server

END PROGRAM
```

